hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"445","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj ko grahan laga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko Namaz padhai, phir khade hue aur qiyam lamba kya, phir ruku kya aur ruku lamba kya, phir khade hue aur qiyam lamba kya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir ruku kya aur ruku lamba kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya aur sajda kya, phir dusri rakat mein waisa hi kya, phir phire jab ke suraj khul chuka tha, phir logon ko khutba diya aur Allah ki hamd ki aur us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya ke suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, kisi ke marne aur na kisi ke jeene se unhein grahan lagta hai, phir jab tum ye dekho to Allah se dua mango aur takbeer kaho aur sadqa do. Phir farmaya ke aey Ummat-e-Muhammad, Allah ki qasam Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahi ke us ka banda zina kare ya us ki bandi zina kare, aey Ummat-e-Muhammad, Allah ki qasam agar tum jante jo main janta hun to thoda hanste aur bahut rote."
"446","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke suraj ko grahan laga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi jab ke log Aap ke sath they, phir lambe qiyam mein khade hue Surah Baqara jaisa, unhon ne kaha ke phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya, phir sar uthaya aur lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kya, phir lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya aur lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kya, phir phire jab ke suraj khul chuka tha, phir farmaya ke suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, kisi ke marne aur na kisi ke jeene se unhein grahan lagta hai, phir jab tum ye dekho to Allah ko yaad karo. Unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hum ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap ne apne is muqam mein koi cheez li phir hum ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap peechhe hate. To Aap ne farmaya ke maine Jannat dekhi aur us mein se aik guchha liya, aur agar main use le leta to tum is mein se khate jab tak duniya baqi hai, aur maine aag dekhi aur aaj jaisa manzar kabhi na dekha jo zyada haulnak ho, aur maine us ke zyada rehne walon ko aurtein dekha. Unhon ne kaha ke kyun ya Rasulullah, Aap ne farmaya ke un ke kufr ki wajah se. Kaha gaya ke kya wo Allah se kufr kartin hain. Aap ne farmaya ke wo khawind ki nashukri karti hain aur ehsaan ki nashukri karti hain, agar tum un mein se kisi se tamam umr ehsaan karo phir tum se koi cheez dekhe to kahe ke maine tum se kabhi bhalai na dekhi."
"447","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Amra bint Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke aik yahoodi aurat mangne aai aur kaha ke Allah tumhein qabr ke azaab se panah de. Phir Aaisha ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sawal kya ke kya logon ko un ki qabron mein azaab diya jata hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah se is se panah mangte hue farmaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik subah sawari par sawaar hue aur suraj ko grahan laga, phir chasht ke waqt laute aur hujron ke darmiyan se guzre, phir Namaz padhne khade hue aur log Aap ke peechhe khade hue, phir lambe qiyam mein khade hue phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya, phir sar uthaya aur lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya aur sajda kya, phir lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya aur lambe qiyam mein khade hue jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lambe ruku mein ruku kya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sar uthaya phir sajda kya, phir phire aur jo Allah ne chaha kaha, phir unhein hukm diya ke qabr ke azaab se panah mangein."
"448","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne Fatima bint Munzir se, unhon ne Abu Bakr Siddiq ki beti Asma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ke paas aai jab suraj ko grahan laga tha, to log khade Namaz padh rahe they aur wo khadi Namaz padh rahi thin, to maine kaha ke logon ko kya hai, to unhon ne apne haath se aasman ki taraf ishara kya aur kaha ke Subhan Allah. To maine kaha ke kya nishani hai, to unhon ne apne sar se ishara kya ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke main khadi hui yahan tak ke mujhe behoshi ne dhaank liya aur main apne sar par pani dalne lagi, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd ki aur us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya ke koi cheez nahi jo maine na dekhi ho magar maine use apne is muqam mein dekh liya hai yahan tak ke Jannat aur aag, aur meri taraf wahi ki gai hai ke tum qabron mein aazmae jate ho Dajjal ke fitne jaisa ya qareeb, mujhe maloom nahi in dono mein se kaunsi Asma ne kahi, tum mein se kisi ke paas laya jata hai aur use kaha jata hai ke is shakhs ke bare mein tumhara ilm kya hai, phir raha momin ya yaqeen wala, mujhe maloom nahi in dono mein se kaunsi Asma ne kahi, to wo kehta hai ke wo Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain, hamare paas wazeh dalail aur hidayat lekar aae to hum ne jawab diya aur iman laae aur pairvi ki, to use kaha jata hai ke nek ban kar so, hum jante they ke tum momin they, aur raha munafiq ya shak wala, mujhe maloom nahi in dono mein se kaunsi Asma ne kahi, to wo kehta hai ke main nahi janta, maine logon ko koi baat kehte suna to maine kahi."
